{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12232020","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12232020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1223202001:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님이시군요. 어서 오세요!","source_cn":"是<style=stress><player_name...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1E4FC4DC39E8E658","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님이시군요. 어서 오세요!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님이시군요. 어서 오세요!","variant_male_record_index":"138266","variant_female_record_index":"138267","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1223202002:1":{"text":"일자리는 찾으셨나요?","source_cn":"你们找到活了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C330A9EF664B387","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1223202003:1":{"text":"찾기는 찾았는데 말입니다...","source_cn":"找是找到了，但……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA420B1CDC90BB109","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1223202004:1":{"text":"아, 아르! 큰일 났어!","source_cn":"阿、阿尔，大事不好了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE0F232992C665D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1223202005:1":{"text":"업타운에 간 솔로에게 문제가 생긴 모양이야. 가줄 수 있어?","source_cn":"梭罗在上城区遇到点麻烦，你能去看下吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA7F7777E3412AC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1223202006:1":{"text":"오, 또 문제가 생겼네요. 같이 가주시겠습니까?","source_cn":"你瞧，又来了。要跟我一起去看看吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6567F02535E94C72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1223202007:1":{"text":"구경하는 건 괜찮아요. 하지만 미리 말해두는데! 우린 도와주러 온 게 아니라 감시하러 온 거예요!","source_cn":"看热闹可以，但先说好，我们不是来帮忙的，我们是来监督你们的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D17FDE46D4853B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1223202008:1":{"text":"그럼요, 그럼요. 사실 여러분이 우리 곁에 서 있는 것만으로도 많은 문제가 해결된답니다.","source_cn":"当然，当然。其实只要你们站在我们身边，就能解决很多问题了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB511C8EFB990ADD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1223202009:1":{"text":"대화는 이쯤 하고 어서 가죠. 더 늦으면 무슨 일이 일어날지 몰라요.","source_cn":"不说了，快点走出发吧，去晚了还不知道会发生什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1BC05737CE7D28E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:水鬼帮阿尔":{"text":"물귀신파 아르","source":"水鬼帮阿尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:水鬼帮奈克":{"text":"나이크","source":"水鬼帮奈克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"s